" init script for planck"
" Copyright (C) 2026 nineties "

" This script bootstraps Planck from its minimal core into a full-featured "
" programming language by leveraging its langugage extension capabilities. "

" === Builtin Symbols === "
Def{true, Quote{true}}
Def{false, Quote{false}}
Def{none, Quote{none}}

Def{f, Lambda{Tuple{x}, Apply{print, Tuple{x}}}}
Apply{f, Tuple{0}}

Fusion{print, eval}

QuasiQuote{UnQuote{0}}
QuasiQuote{QuasiQuote{UnQuote{0}}}
QuasiQuote{QuasiQuote{UnQuote{UnQuote{0}}}}
